{"id":824,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p data-pm-slice=\"2 2 []\">为全力促进材料科学与工程学院2026届毕业生实现高质量充分就业，切实满足毕业生择业需求，我院于4月8日上午在东区训练馆举办专场招聘会，学院领导莅临现场指导工作。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MozVoRLm-PoRvaouR9DnRvDnRCYLRlUPL4f2LmUYn7-iM770gihFp2hmCIa0LkyYM1hkLYhkUzn2U46kL7Q7L4fkUzWfn7UaUzUsLlUDnz6Fnm7iMNlaM46FM47ZMmlJqjfjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lz94Lm9Jqdnnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=18328&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/026B3BA4FC7B0FD30BA2ADD0A471D6E7/F156E077/71865\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MozVoRLm-PoRvaouR9DnRvDnRCYLRlUPL4f2LmUYn7-iM770gihFp2hmCIa0LkyYM1hkLYhkUzn2U46kL7Q7L4fkUzWfn7UaUzUsLlUDnz6Fnm7iMNlaM46FM47ZMmlJqjfjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lz94Lm9Jqdnnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=18328&e=.jpg\"></p><p data-pm-slice=\"4 1 []\">本次招聘会邀请省内外26家优质企业到场招才引智，覆盖我院所有专业，为毕业生提供大量优质岗位。我院领导鼓励同学们，要主动适应就业市场变化，积极抢抓就业机会，顺利实现高质量就业。招聘会上，本科与硕士毕业生踊跃投递简历，与企业面对面沟通洽谈，企业负责人对我院学子的综合素质与求职表现给予高度认可。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MnmUosnz74MR-ZMu462nzVRL8-PLz6U2MRrVLmlbo7LPM8C0gihFp2hmCIa0nSh7MYyZokh2UmG8nm6kUNVRMNMRUlWfL8MVM4v8olUZnzTFM7l8nmfRU46FL4V2nRCJqjfjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lz94Lm9Jqdnnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=18328&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/ED788FB04F7BBAC6CCABA3CE7749D8E9/4E4F0CC7/31FD6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MnmUosnz74MR-ZMu462nzVRL8-PLz6U2MRrVLmlbo7LPM8C0gihFp2hmCIa0nSh7MYyZokh2UmG8nm6kUNVRMNMRUlWfL8MVM4v8olUZnzTFM7l8nmfRU46FL4V2nRCJqjfjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lz94Lm9Jqdnnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=18328&e=.jpg\"></p><p data-pm-slice=\"2 2 []\">本次专场招聘会的顺利开展，不仅为我院2026届毕业生提供了优质的就业机会，更搭建了校企深度合作的桥梁。下一步，材料科学与工程学院将持续深耕就业服务，精准对接企业用人需求，不断优化就业服务体系，为毕业生高质量就业保驾护航。</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://3y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MozVoRLm-PoRvaouR9DnRvDnRCYLRlUPL4f2LmUYn7-iM770gihFp2hmCIa0LkyYM1hkLYhkUzn2U46kL7Q7L4fkUzWfn7UaUzUsLlUDnz6Fnm7iMNlaM46FM47ZMmlJqjfjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47iMzL0Lz94Lm9Jqdnnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1553&nid=18328&e=.jpg"}